  npcName: Bishop
  npcPortrait: {fileID: -8773453825056629232, guid: 5f22ee5b08cd7ab468c9317994e6f5dd,
    type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Welcome to the archives. I\u2019ve read the ledgers of those who walked before
    you. Most failed not from lack of courage, but from lack of <color=orange>foresight</color>."
  - "Fortuna\u2019s system is cyclical. You\u2019ll find silver coins here, but sometimes
    you\u2019ll need bronze for old paths, or gold for the depths. The <color=orange>Guild
    Receptionist</color> can <color=orange>convert them</color>."
  - Convert <color=orange>ten bronze coins to silver</color>, then use what you have
    wisely and pull for a <color=orange>silver key</color>.
  - "The next <color=orange>staircase</color> demands it. Study the flow. Don\u2019t
    just spend blindly."
  - May Fortuna bless you.
  - "Conversion isn\u2019t cheating\u2014it\u2019s strategy."
  typingSpeed: 0.05
